  "title": "Cincinnati Chili I",
  "description": "This is an unusual no-bean chili made with ground beef, cinnamon, cloves and unsweetened chocolate in a beef and tomato base. Serve over spaghetti noodles with shredded cheddar cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
